<title>HONG KONG: Hon Kwok Land interim net down 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Hon Kwok Land interim net down 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.7	 vs 8.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5	 vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.04 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    51.31     vs 72.88</p>
<p>    Turnover		     74.99     vs 150.08</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hon Kwok Land Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 23-27, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 21, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Hon Kwok Land is a property group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$6.63 million compensation on acquisition of a portion of land by the local authority and HK$3.59 million loss on surrender of a vacant site to the local authority.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted to reflect the bonus issue of one-for-10 shares during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
